    {
        "id": 41,
        "option_name": "last_release",
        "option_value": "{\"version\":\"1.0.0-rc1\",\"name\":\"v1.0.0-rc1 - Pre-Release\",\"body\":\"# \\ud83d\\ude80 RJ CMS v1.0.0-rc1 (Release Candidate 1)\\r\\n\\r\\nWelcome to the first pre-release of **RJ CMS**! This version marks a major milestone with the completion of the core architecture and several advanced features. \\r\\n\\r\\n> **\\u26a0\\ufe0f Pre-Release Notice:** This is a Release Candidate. While the core is stable, you may encounter minor bugs. We do **not** recommend using this version in a live production environment just yet.\\r\\n\\r\\n## \\u2728 What's New in this Version?\\r\\n\\r\\n- **AI Content Generator & Bulk Translate:** Integrated with OpenRouter to automatically write posts and translate content (preserving HTML structure).\\r\\n- **Two-Factor Authentication (2FA):** Fully working Google Authenticator support for admin accounts.\\r\\n- **Custom Error Pages:** Brand new, animated standalone pages for 403, 404, 419, 429, 500, and 503.\\r\\n- **Maintenance Mode:** Easily put your site under maintenance with a beautiful animated 503 page.\\r\\n- **RTL Support:** Full Right-to-Left support for Arabic, Persian, and other RTL languages via middleware.\\r\\n- **Language Switcher Fix:** Language selection now persists across sessions and page reloads.\\r\\n- **Performance Optimizations:** Lazy loading implemented for all images, and LCP (Largest Contentful Paint) optimized for main post images.\\r\\n- **RJBuilder:** Visual page builder with drag-and-drop, responsive controls, and dynamic tags.\\r\\n\\r\\n## \\ud83d\\udee0\\ufe0f Installation\\r\\n\\r\\nPlease refer to the `README.md` file for detailed installation instructions. \\r\\n\\r\\n**Default Admin:**\\r\\n- Email: `admin@admin.com`\\r\\n- Password: `admin123`\\r\\n\\r\\n## \\u23f3 What's Next?\\r\\n\\r\\n- Massive translation updates for ES, DE, and PT languages.\\r\\n- KYC (Identity Verification) module.\\r\\n- Final UI\\/UX polish and bug fixes before the stable `v1.0.0` release.\\r\\n\\r\\n---\\r\\n*Thank you for testing RJ CMS! Please report any bugs or feedback in the Issues tab.*\",\"url\":\"https:\\/\\/github.com\\/rj-nexus\\/rj-nexus\\/releases\\/tag\\/v1.0.0-rc1\",\"published_at\":\"2026-10-22T03:44:52Z\",\"prerelease\":true,\"has_update\":false}",
        "option_group": "updates",
        "option_type": "text",
        "autoload": 1,
        "created_at": "2026-10-13 15:06:51",
        "updated_at": "2026-10-30 08:26:27"
    },
